<title>AUSTRALIA: Sunraysia yr net rises to A$5.34 mln.</title>
<headline>Sunraysia yr net rises to A$5.34 mln.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended June 30</p>
<p>	    (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		  7.89 vs   6.60</p>
<p>    Net profit			  5.34 vs   3.26</p>
<p>    Sales				65.01 vs  60.07</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)	   7.0 vs 7.0</p>
<p>    Total dividend (cents)	  11.0 vs 11.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Sunraysia Television Ltd is a television broadcaster.</p>
</text>
